# Testing & Database Safety

- Automated tests and AI writes may use only `gloaming_test`.
- If `TEST_DATABASE_URL` or its target database is not confirmed as `gloaming_test`, stop; never fall back to the development database.
- Never run cleanup, unscoped deletes, resets, seeds, or test migrations against the development database.
- For test or database-write work, load [`test-database-workflow`](../../.agents/skills/test-database-workflow/SKILL.md).
